WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.440 line:55%
Can you change the colour to red?

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.040 line:55%
What if you could control an entire audiovisual experience

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.560 line:55%
simply by speaking?

4
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.800 line:55%
The lighting, the sound,

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.040 line:55%
the video and any other connected system.

6
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.160 line:55%
Meet MAIGIA OS,

7
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.200 line:55%
a revolutionary audiovisual control system

8
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.520 line:55%
powered by artificial intelligence.

9
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.200 line:55%
You set the direction with your voice.

10
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.240 line:55%
AI interprets your commands

11
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.800 line:55%
and puts the connected systems into action.

12
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.360 line:55%
Play a video.

13
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.800 line:55%
Change the lighting. Adjust the music.

14
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.880 line:55%
Open a map.

15
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.280 line:55%
Explore a project.

16
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.920 line:55%
Your voice directs the experience.

17
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.560 line:55%
During a presentation,

18
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.600 line:55%
