19
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.120 line:55%
MAIGIA OS lets you follow that path.

20
00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.280 line:55%
Find a destination on the map.

21
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.640 line:55%
Explore its photographs

22
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.760 line:55%
