33
00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.560 line:55%
You lead. AI pilots the systems.

34
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.280 line:55%
Your audience experiences the result.

35
00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:25.960 line:55%
MAIGIA OS.

36
